### **6. Market Opportunity & Growth Potential:**

India's specialty steel market is poised for growth, fueled by advancements in infrastructure and manufacturing. Erasteel India is well-positioned to capitalize on this trend by leveraging its established supplier relationships and expanding its product portfolio to meet evolving industry demands.

### **7. Business Model & Revenue Streams:**

Erasteel India generates revenue through the import and distribution of specialty steel products. The company's monetization strategies include establishing long-term supply agreements with manufacturers and offering value-added services such as technical support and customized solutions.

